## 8. Performance Benchmarks (Baseline)

**Test Date**: 2026-10-19  
**Hardware**: Intel i7, 16GB RAM, SSD  
**Network**: Fiber 100 Mbps

| Operation | Current Performance | Target Performance | Notes |
|-----------|---------------------|-------------------|-------|
| Single account scan | ~2 minutes | <30 seconds | Playwright navigation latency |
| Full cycle (26 accounts) | 52 minutes | <10 minutes | Sequential processing |
| Event dispatcher cycle | 10 seconds | <1 second | Polling interval |
| WhatsApp message send | ~500ms | <200ms | WhatsApp Web API latency |
| PDF OCR (10 pages) | ~30 seconds | <5 seconds | pdfjs-dist on CPU |
| Database query (obligations by company) | <10ms | <5ms | No index on company_id |
| AI inference (Gemma 4, 100 tokens) | ~2 seconds | <500ms | llama.cpp on CPU |
| Full pipeline (scan → event → delivery) | ~2 minutes | <30 seconds | End-to-end latency |

